# Fast gate: format the staged files. Nothing heavier — typecheck and test run at
# pre-push, and authoritatively in CI, so commits stay quick while working.
#
# `pnpm format:check` is a CI step separate from `nx affected`, because prettier
# covers files no Nx project owns. It is also the step that failed on PR #342,
# the first PR this repo's loop opened unattended: the formatter this repo's own
# CLAUDE.md documents had simply not been run. Formatting on the way in means
# that failure cannot be created in the first place.
pnpm exec lint-staged
